5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m glad we’re all here. I just want us to pick something that keeps our lane friendly, not just tidy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Kenji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Kenji: I’m glad we’re all here. I just want us to pick something that keeps our lane friendly, not just tidy.""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. We must find a way that lets us all live peacefully together, without new worries.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know the actual time cost before we commit. Who is responsible for the daily upkeep?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure no one gets stuck with the worst spot forever. Who is checking if the space is actually fair for everyone,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we choose, we must understand the true cost. Who has calculated what this corner already drains from our pockets each year?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that’s a fair point. @Asuka, your time worry is valid too. Let’s look at the numbers and the hours together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, you are right to worry about fairness. Let us look closely at the measurements to see if the space suits each home equally.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, I appreciate the sentiment, but feelings don’t fix the schedule. I need the crew leader’s arrival time to calculate the exact window we’d be trapped in.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the truck time is important, but I also want to see the ward complaint log. I need to know if one house is already suffering the most","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the complaint log is wise. @Asuka, the truck time is vital. Let us also check the block ledger to see our yearly drain.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, checking the complaint log is smart. @Asuka, the truck time is key. Let’s also look at the ward filing requirements to see how hard a permanent fix would be.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, the filing requirements are useful. @Servas, the ledger is essential. I also want to visit the station block’s bin house to see what living beside one is truly like.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the filing requirements are crucial for the timeline. @Shizue, the bin house visit is wise. I will check the ward filing requirements and the truck arrival time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I will check the ward complaint log and the measurements of the five frontages. I need to see if the burden is truly shared or just hidden.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your focus on the filing requirements is sharp. I will examine the block ledger and the ward subsidy to understand our financial footing before we proceed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, your idea to visit the station block is brilliant. I will check the station block’s meeting minutes and the statements from the residents’ meeting to see how this actually feels for neighbors.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I am glad you are looking into the minutes. I will check the station block’s bin house and the ward complaint log to understand the daily reality.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will confirm my choices: the ward filing requirements and the truck arrival time. These define the operational limits we must respect.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will confirm my choices: the ward complaint log and the measurements of the five frontages. I need to see if the burden is truly shared or just hidden.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will confirm my choices: the block ledger and the ward subsidy. We must know our financial footing before we proceed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
